      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "John McKee, the son of Scottish immigrant David McKee, founded McKeesport in 1746 and later traded land across Pittsburgh and Versailles Township.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        27,
        29,
        30
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.eastmckeesportboro.com/1195/History",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The area that became East McKeesport was once part of the old Borough Building’s property before the borough was formally established.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
