      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.eastmckeesportboro.com/1195/History",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "During the 1929–1930s, much of East McKeesport’s early history was documented by Alfred Mann in a book that remains a key local resource.",
